{"municipality_code":"24341","pref":"三重県","city":"菰野町","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"菰野町には、田口村、田口新田、田光村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には城跡や陣屋跡、史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「田光城跡」、「千種城跡」、「杉谷西方遺跡群」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、田口村や田口新田にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 ゆかりの人物では服部忠行や永井啓弍に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「三嶽寺」や「廣幡神社」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。 江戸時代の菰野藩に関わる記憶も、古い道標や領主碑、地域の案内板を探す手がかりになります。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":148,"rank":501,"percentile":73.5,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":3,"rank":1182,"percentile":34.7,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":51,"rank":450,"percentile":75.7,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":7,"rank":1128,"percentile":34.2,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":4,"rank":933,"percentile":43.7,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":27,"rank":653,"percentile":64.6,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_peop